        "H200": 16,
        "B200": 16
      },
      "tf32": 4,
      "E4M3": 32,
      "E5M2": 32
    },
    "accumulator_input": {
      "fp16, bf16, tf32 on every GPU; E4M3, E5M2 on Ada and L40S": "c is accumulated in the block FMA",
      "E4M3, E5M2 on H100 and H200": "the recorded d is A\u00b7B with a zero accumulator (wgmma); the c files are not used",
      "E4M3, E5M2 on B200": "the recorded d is the block FMA from c = 0 with c then added in binary32 with round-to-nearest-even"
    },
    "notes": [
      "The L40S files are byte-identical to the Ada files.",
      "The a and b files of a format are shared by H100, H200 and B200, and by Ada and L40S.",
      "The TF32 a and b files hold the same values as the V100 FP16 vectors of v0.5."
    ],
